---
title: Route Protection Flow
---
flowchart TD
    R1[User navigates to /_auth/*] --> R2[beforeLoad executes]
    R2 --> R3[Call /auth/me with credentials]
    R3 --> R4{Cookie valid?}
    R4 -->|Yes| R5[Return user to context]
    R4 -->|No| R6[Redirect to /login]
    R5 --> R7[Render protected route]
